          },
          {
            "en": "All Poncho Zombies are equipped with iron Shields, with both Poncho and Shield durability increased by 50%",
            "zh": "所有斗篷僵尸均携带铁质锅炉，斗篷和锅炉耐久度+50%"
          },
          {
            "en": "All Prospector Zombies gain +300% attack damage and -25% dynamic point requirement",
            "zh": "所有淘金僵尸的攻击力+300%，动态点数需求-25%"
          },
          {
            "en": "Dynamic zombie spawning features different zombie types and point increments",
            "zh": "动态出怪的种类和点数增量有所不同"
          },
          {
            "en": "All lawn mowers are removed, minecart tracks are shortened and original track positions cannot be planted on",
            "zh": "失去所有割草机，矿车轨道缩短且原轨道位置不可种植植物"
